+# 2.4.0
+
+- Loyalty points round to the nearest point instead of down. An order of
+  19.99 now earns 2 points instead of 1. Points already booked do not change.
+
 # 2.3.0
 
 - Loyalty points are booked when the order is paid, not when it is placed.
